# cabin_rain: the rain's curtain over the whole plate (BUILD_PLAN S7, 5.8):
# tiles of streaks one pixel wide and three tall in glacier blue, falling a
# little left, lighter high in the frame and heavier low, staggered and
# flipped row to row, about 2% of the plate. At night they go navy, so they
# cross the lit windows as dark lines. On the near layer, at the plate's
# origin.
